# Where enquiries are delivered. Any endpoint that accepts a JSON POST:
# an n8n Webhook node, Make, Zapier, Formspree, or your own handler.
#
# It is read on the SERVER only (app/api/enquire/route.js) and never reaches the
# browser — do not rename it to NEXT_PUBLIC_*, which would publish it.
#
# Left unset, the enquiry form still works: it falls back to opening a
# pre-filled email to hello@evolvecrm.co.uk, as the original static demo did.
ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=

# The POST body:
# { name, business, email, phone, team, plan, message, source, submitted }
